[
    {
        "id": "secondary_gate_comment",
        "type": "comment",
        "z": "gate_main_tab",
        "name": "═══════════════ SECONDARY GATE CONTROLS - 6 Relays ═══════════════",
        "info": "## Secondary Sliding Gate Control\n\nProvides controls for the secondary sliding gate with 6 relays.\n\n### Gate Control Relays (1-4):\n- **Relay 1**: Close gate (1 sec pulse)\n- **Relay 2**: Open gate (1 sec pulse)\n- **Relay 3**: Trigger automation (1 sec pulse)\n- **Relay 4**: Stop (1 sec pulse)\n\n### Light Control Relays (5-6):\n- **Relay 5**: Left light (120 sec pulse)\n- **Relay 6**: Right light (120 sec pulse)\n\n### How it works:\n1. Subscribe to SecondGate/STAT/RelayX for status\n2. Display switch in dashboard\n3. When toggled, send pulse (1s for gate, 120s for lights)\n4. Publish to SecondGate/CMD/RelayX\n\n### MQTT Topics:\n- Status: SecondGate/STAT/Relay[1-6]\n- Command: SecondGate/CMD/Relay[1-6]\n\n### Dependencies:\n- Requires: ui_group_secondary_gate (from base config)\n- Requires: mqtt_broker_local",
        "x": 330,
        "y": 1120,
        "wires": []
    },
    {
        "id": "secondary_relay1_in",
        "type": "mqtt in",
        "z": "gate_main_tab",
        "name": "Secondary Gate Relay 1 Status",
        "topic": "SecondGate/STAT/Relay1",
        "qos": "2",
        "datatype": "auto-detect",
        "broker": "mqtt_broker_local",
        "nl": false,
        "rap": false,
        "rh": 0,
        "inputs": 0,
        "x": 240,
        "y": 1200,
        "wires": [
            [
                "secondary_relay1_switch",
                "secondary_relay1_store"
            ]
        ]
    },
    {
        "id": "secondary_relay1_store",
        "type": "function",
        "z": "gate_main_tab",
        "name": "Store Relay 1 State",
        "func": "let secondaryState = flow.get('secondary_gate_state') || {};\nsecondaryState.relay1 = msg.payload;\nsecondaryState.lastUpdate = new Date().toISOString();\nflow.set('secondary_gate_state', secondaryState);\nreturn null;",
        "outputs": 0,
        "noerr": 0,
        "initialize": "",
        "finalize": "",
        "libs": [],
        "x": 540,
        "y": 1160,
        "wires": []
    },
